RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Upper-body calisthenics
DESCRIPTION:Stop 2 reps short on every set. Quality over fatigue.\n• Warm-
 up: wrist circles\, shoulder dislocates\, scap pull-ups — 5 min\n• Chest-
 to-wall handstand — 5 × 15–20s\n• Pull-ups — 3 × ~8–10\, stop 2 short\n• 
 Dips\, elbows to ~90° — 3 × stop 2 short\n• Inverted rows — 3 × 10–12\n• 
 Hollow hold — 4 × 10–15s\n• Tuck L-sit on dip bars — 3 × 10s\n• Mobility:
  hips\, hamstrings\, groin — 10 min
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Upper-body calisthenics
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
