UID:plan-1-astro-skill@elijah-os
DTSTAMP:20261109T000000Z
DTSTART:20261110T154500
DTEND:20261110T162000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Astro: skill sequences
DESCRIPTION:Solo. Bring 3+ balls and 4–6 cones\; use the kickboard or fenc
 e (or a rebounder). About 75% pace: half speed first\, then full speed.\n
 • Warm-up: jog\, dynamic stretches\, 3 build-ups — 8 min\n• Pass into the
  kickboard\, check away\, take the rebound on the half-turn\, drive past 
 a cone\, shoot — 4 × 5 reps\n• Weak foot: first touches off the kickboard
 \, then weak-foot finishes — 10 min
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Astro: skill sequences
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
