DTSTART:20261110T170000
DTEND:20261110T173500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY
SUMMARY:Lower body at home (light)
DESCRIPTION:Plyos first while you’re fresh\, low and springy (academy is t
 omorrow). Then strength: stop 2–3 reps short on every set.\n• Plyometrics
 : pogo hops (quick\, stiff ankles) — 2 × 15\n• Plyometrics: lateral bound
 s (stick each landing) — 2 × 5 each side\n• Split squats — 2 × 8 each leg
 \n• Single-leg RDL — 2 × 8 each leg\n• Single-leg glute bridge — 2 × 12\n
 • Nordic curl negatives — 2 × 3–5\n• Skill snack: tuck L-sit holds — 10 m
 in
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Lower body at home (light)
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
